{"id": "lib/stress/breath_phases.dart:offset-3498", "file": "lib/stress/breath_phases.dart", "location": "offset-3498", "text": "'Four counts each way, holds included. Steadying when your '\n'head is racing.'", "sha256": "b2a3c4322ed5338d634450e06954f0d28583fe091496cc7287548894a5ac8abe", "kind": "dart", "start": 3498, "end": 3584, "line": 113}
{"id": "lib/stress/breath_phases.dart:offset-3880", "file": "lib/stress/breath_phases.dart", "location": "offset-3880", "text": "'A long hold and a longer exhale. Usually used to get to '\n'sleep.'", "sha256": "0deac002e05225508b41263eb5fc971863461a2a250f5e7799b6b595119bc7b7", "kind": "dart", "start": 3880, "end": 3955, "line": 125}
