{"id": "lib/stress/breath_phases.dart:offset-4209", "file": "lib/stress/breath_phases.dart", "location": "offset-4209", "text": "'Out for twice as long as in. No holds, so it is easy to keep '\n'up for a while.'", "sha256": "db52584d227270aa8ce2ceecca7aaca5fdf12f7a42e217bbb64f1c17a6034686", "kind": "dart", "start": 4209, "end": 4298, "line": 136}
